WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:06.560
Hi, Mystery Recapped here. Today I am&nbsp;
going to explain a drama fantasy film&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:06.560 --> 00:00:11.600
called “Ricky.” Spoilers ahead!&nbsp;
Watch out and take care!
&nbsp;

00:00:15.760 --> 00:00:21.040
The movie begins with a tired mother of two&nbsp;
named Katie contemplating putting her baby&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:21.040 --> 00:00:27.440
Ricky up for adoption. Katie works a low wage&nbsp;
job at a cosmetics factory and lives in welfare&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:27.440 --> 00:00:32.640
housing in eastern Paris. She says she hasn’t&nbsp;
been able to look after Ricky and her daughter&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:32.640 --> 00:00:38.640
Lisa by herself after her partner left her. The&nbsp;
social worker reminds her that abandoning a child&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:38.640 --> 00:00:44.000
is a big decision and she should spend more&nbsp;
time making sure that she is taking the right&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:49.680
step. For the meantime, the social worker offers&nbsp;
to see if domestic help can be arranged for Katie&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:49.680 --> 00:00:54.720
to help her look after the baby. Katie is&nbsp;
also advised to file a police report that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:54.720 --> 00:00:59.680
her baby’s father has abandoned her.
The movie then flashes back to the past&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:59.680 --> 00:01:06.160
before baby Ricky was born. After waking up, Lily&nbsp;
opens the curtains and wakes up her perennially&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:06.160 --> 00:01:11.120
tired mother. Lily then heads to the kitchen&nbsp;
and begins preparing breakfast for herself&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:11.120 --> 00:01:15.920
and her mother. The mother-daughter then take&nbsp;
a shower and have breakfast together before&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:15.920 --> 00:01:20.960
leaving for Lily’s school in Katie’s scooter.&nbsp;
Katie promises to pick her up later before&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:20.960 --> 00:01:26.000
kissing her goodbye and heads to her work.
At the factory, Katie locks eyes with a man&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:32.320
named Paco Sanchez. Paco walks up to her during&nbsp;
a cigarette break and introduces himself. Katie&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:32.320 --> 00:01:37.040
lends him a cigarette and Paco reveals that&nbsp;
he recently started working at the factory.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:37.040 --> 00:01:42.000
One thing leads to another and the two end&nbsp;
up hooking up in the washroom. As a result,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:42.000 --> 00:01:47.280
Katie takes time finishing her daily work quota&nbsp;
and gets in trouble with her boss who scolds her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:47.280 --> 00:01:53.040
for being lazy. Katie also arrives late to pick&nbsp;
up Lily from school. Moreover, she forgets to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:53.040 --> 00:01:58.160
bring Lily’s helmet and she is forced to give&nbsp;
Lily her own helmet on their ride back home.
&nbsp;

00:01:58.160 --> 00:02:03.200
The next day, Paco meets Katie outside the&nbsp;
factory. Katie expresses her embarrassment&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:03.200 --> 00:02:07.040
over the fact that they hooked up right&nbsp;
after their first meeting, saying it is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:07.040 --> 00:02:11.920
usually not her style. Paco resonates with her,&nbsp;
saying he doesn’t hook up on first dates either.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:14.400 --> 00:02:20.160
After making some more small talk, Paco asks her&nbsp;
out on a date. Katie who has been longing for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:20.160 --> 00:02:25.680
company couldn’t be more excited and she accepts&nbsp;
the date, much to Lily’s dismay who wanted to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:25.680 --> 00:02:31.120
play dress-up with her mother. At the date, Paco&nbsp;
asks Katie about Lily’s father and she reveals&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:31.120 --> 00:02:37.600
that he lives in southern france. Lily’s father&nbsp;
wanted Katie to abort her so he wants nothing to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:37.600 --> 00:02:42.240
do with Katie and their daughter. Meanwhile,&nbsp;
Paco reveals that he was briefly married in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:42.240 --> 00:02:47.840
Spain when he was young. After the date, Katie&nbsp;
takes him back home and the two make love again.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:47.840 --> 00:02:53.280
Poor Lily has a hard time falling asleep due to&nbsp;
the sound of Katie and Paco’s love making.
&nbsp;

00:02:53.280 --> 00:02:57.920
The next day, Lily wakes up to Katie and&nbsp;
Paco having breakfast together. Katie tries&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:57.920 --> 00:03:02.560
to introduce her daughter to her date but the&nbsp;
little girl isn’t interested and she runs back&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:02.560 --> 00:03:08.320
to her room. To spend more time with Paco, Katie&nbsp;
also signs Lily up for the school bus service&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:08.320 --> 00:03:13.920
and Paco eventually moves into Katie’s home. 
A year passes by and Katie becomes pregnant&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:13.920 --> 00:03:18.880
with Paco's child. One day, Paco gets a&nbsp;
call at work from the hospital and learns&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:18.880 --> 00:03:24.560
that Katie has unexpectedly gone into labor. He&nbsp;
rushes to be by Katie’s side with Lily. After&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:24.560 --> 00:03:29.920
Katie gives birth to a healthy baby boy, Paco&nbsp;
asks Lily for suggestions for the baby’s name&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:29.920 --> 00:03:36.800
and Lily names the baby Ricky. Paco turns Lily’s&nbsp;
room into a nursery, much to her dismay and she&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:36.800 --> 00:03:41.520
begins to feel sidelined by her mother, who&nbsp;
spends most of her time with the new baby.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:41.520 --> 00:03:47.040
Lily also doesn’t like the fact that Katie&nbsp;
keeps insisting that Lily call Paco ‘dad’.
&nbsp;

00:03:47.040 --> 00:03:52.000
Katie spending most of her time looking after&nbsp;
the baby also begins to take a toll on her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:52.000 --> 00:03:57.600
relationship with Paco and one day, Lily&nbsp;
catches Paco cozying up to another woman&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:57.600 --> 00:04:02.320
outside their apartment building. However,&nbsp;
Lily decides to keep it to herself.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:02.320 --> 00:04:07.920
Paco later returns home late, saying he was&nbsp;
out with his “friends”. Paco’s changed attitude&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:07.920 --> 00:04:13.200
worries Katie and the two get into an argument.&nbsp;
However, the two make up before going to bed,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:13.200 --> 00:04:18.000
promising to be there for each other more. 
Soon, Katie starts going to work again and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:18.000 --> 00:04:23.040
Paco is left to look after the baby during&nbsp;
the day. One day, when Katie returns home,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:23.040 --> 00:04:28.640
she notices a strange bruise on baby Ricky’s&nbsp;
back. She asks Paco about it but he denies&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:28.640 --> 00:04:33.920
knowing anything about it. Paco insists that it’s&nbsp;
nothing but over the course of the next few days,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:33.920 --> 00:04:40.000
the baby grows another bruise on his back. The&nbsp;
poor baby also keeps crying all the time. One day,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:40.000 --> 00:04:45.520
Katie confronts Paco about the twin bruises.&nbsp;
Paco again denies knowing anything about it but&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:45.520 --> 00:04:52.480
Katie accuses him of beating Ricky. This upsets&nbsp;
Ricky and he breaks up with her before leaving. 
&nbsp;

00:04:52.480 --> 00:04:58.480
Seeing Paco storm out in anger, Lily realizes that&nbsp;
he has left for good and the little girl embraces&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:58.480 --> 00:05:04.000
her mother to comfort her. With Paco out of the&nbsp;
picture, Lily becomes Ricky’s prime babysitter.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:04.000 --> 00:05:09.360
One day, Katie returns home to find Ricky missing&nbsp;
from his cradle, where the baby has left behind&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:09.360 --> 00:05:15.680
a strange gooey mark. Lily and Katie frantically&nbsp;
look for the baby. Lo and behold, they locate the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:15.680 --> 00:05:21.040
baby on top of the closet. When they bring the&nbsp;
baby down, to their astonishment, they notice&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:21.040 --> 00:05:26.560
two wings growing from Ricky’s shoulder blades.&nbsp;
It seems Ricky can move his wings which help him&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:26.560 --> 00:05:32.640
levitate. Katie gives the baby a bath and wash the&nbsp;
blood off his little wings. She decides to keep&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:32.640 --> 00:05:38.160
Ricky caged in his cradle to keep him from hurting&nbsp;
himself and she also warns Lily against saying&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:38.160 --> 00:05:43.200
anything about Ricky in her school, fearing it&nbsp;
would only attract unnecessary attention towards&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:43.200 --> 00:05:49.520
the baby. At times, Katie feels the urge to call&nbsp;
Paco but she can’t ever bring herself to do it.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:49.520 --> 00:05:55.520
Since developing the wings, Ricky sleeps well&nbsp;
and becomes cheerful. In one week, Ricky’s wings&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:55.520 --> 00:06:02.640
grow 17 cm long and Katie designs a custom dress&nbsp;
for the baby. As time passes by, Ricky develops&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:02.640 --> 00:06:08.400
feathers on his wings. One day, Paco randomly&nbsp;
shows up at Lily’s school and asks her about Katie&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:08.400 --> 00:06:13.840
and Ricky. He also offers to take her home but&nbsp;
she declines the offer and gets on her bus. 
&nbsp;

00:06:13.840 --> 00:06:19.200
As Ricky grows bigger, Katie buys a helmet and&nbsp;
knee pads for him so that he could fly without&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:19.200 --> 00:06:25.200
hurting himself. Lily tries to tell Katie about&nbsp;
Paco but Katie interrupts her, saying since Ricky&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:25.200 --> 00:06:30.560
started sleeping well, she has forgotten about&nbsp;
Paco. Things finally seem to be going good for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:30.560 --> 00:06:36.480
Katie and her family. She wins a 2000 Euro lottery&nbsp;
using which they go for Christmas shopping.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:36.480 --> 00:06:42.000
Unfortunately, when Lily and Katie are distracted,&nbsp;
Ricky manages to remove his jacket and starts&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:42.000 --> 00:06:47.280
flying, horrifying the shoppers. Katie and Lily&nbsp;
run after the baby to stop him from hurting&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:47.280 --> 00:06:52.960
himself. The authorities soon catch wind of the&nbsp;
strange baby and they shut down the entire store.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:52.960 --> 00:06:59.040
An entire army of police scramble to catch the&nbsp;
baby but without success. Eventually, on Katie’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:59.040 --> 00:07:05.440
advice, they turn off the lights and baby Ricky is&nbsp;
finally caught. Katie is forced to take Ricky to a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:05.440 --> 00:07:11.360
hospital where doctors examine the baby. The head&nbsp;
doctor Bernard asks for Katie’s permission to keep&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:11.360 --> 00:07:17.360
the baby in the hospital for further tests. He&nbsp;
also says that Ricky needs a spacious environment&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:17.360 --> 00:07:23.200
to properly evolve. However, Katie declines the&nbsp;
offer and when she proceeds to take her baby home,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:23.200 --> 00:07:28.160
she is mobbed by people and the media,&nbsp;
desperate to catch a glimpse of the baby.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:28.160 --> 00:07:33.920
Several days pass by but the media continues to&nbsp;
camp outside Katie’s apartment complex. The flying&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:33.920 --> 00:07:39.840
baby has become an international sensation.
One night, Ricky wouldn’t stop crying so Lily&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:39.840 --> 00:07:46.000
lets him fly in his room unbeknownst to Katie who&nbsp;
is taking a shower. Suddenly, the doorbell rings&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:46.000 --> 00:07:51.440
and it is revealed to be Paco. Lily calls out&nbsp;
for her mother who asks Lily to leave her alone&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:51.440 --> 00:07:57.040
with Paco. Katie and Paco apologize to each&nbsp;
other and quickly rekindle their relationship,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:57.040 --> 00:08:02.880
much to Lily’s dismay. Lily expresses her concern&nbsp;
to her half brother who has flown over to the top&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:02.880 --> 00:08:08.800
of the closet yet again. She is upset because she&nbsp;
feels that now that Paco is back again, Katie will&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:08.800 --> 00:08:14.400
spend most of her time with him and Ricky. 
Meanwhile, Paco reveals that all this time, he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:14.400 --> 00:08:19.600
worked in a restaurant in Paris. When Katie asks&nbsp;
if he had any affairs, he tells her that he hooked&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:19.600 --> 00:08:27.840
up with one or two women but it wasn’t anything&nbsp;
serious. Later, Paco meets his son. Baby Ricky&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:27.840 --> 00:08:33.120
doesn’t recognize his father and tries to fly&nbsp;
away when Paco attempts to hold him. Worried about&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:33.120 --> 00:08:38.640
Ricky hurting himself, Katie calls him towards&nbsp;
herself but Paco’s presence scares the baby and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:38.640 --> 00:08:43.760
he refuses to come down. They eventually manage&nbsp;
to bring the baby down and Paco points out that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:43.760 --> 00:08:48.720
the room is too dangerous for Ricky to grow up in&nbsp;
but Katie tells him to shut up because she doesn’t&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:48.720 --> 00:08:53.920
want to be separated from her son. They learn that&nbsp;
baby Ricky has hurt himself from all the flying&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:53.920 --> 00:09:00.080
and they immediately call the doctor. Dr. Bernard&nbsp;
treats Ricky’s wound and reiterates Paco’s point.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:00.080 --> 00:09:04.880
He says that the apartment is not safe for&nbsp;
Ricky to grow up in. Dr. Bernard also suggests&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:04.880 --> 00:09:11.760
a surgical procedure to remove Ricky’s wings,&nbsp;
which he calls safe but painful. However, Katie&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:11.760 --> 00:09:16.960
refuses to put her baby through a surgery.
Later that night, Lily has the urge to cut&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:16.960 --> 00:09:20.720
Ricky’s wings off with a pair of scissors&nbsp;
but before she goes through with it,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:20.720 --> 00:09:26.400
Paco arrives outside the room to kiss his son good&nbsp;
night, prompting Lily to run back to her bed. 
&nbsp;

00:09:26.400 --> 00:09:31.680
The next day, over breakfast, Paco suggests&nbsp;
allowing the media to make a documentary on Ricky&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:31.680 --> 00:09:36.320
in exchange for money. He says this would&nbsp;
give the family proper monetary resources&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:36.320 --> 00:09:42.320
required to look after Ricky. This makes Katie&nbsp;
upset and she accuses Paco of returning back to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:42.320 --> 00:09:47.280
their life so he could make a buck off of&nbsp;
Ricky. However, Paco insists that he only&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:47.280 --> 00:09:51.680
returned to look after his family and reminds&nbsp;
Katie how she previously baselessly accused&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:51.680 --> 00:09:56.480
him of beating Ricky, asking her to trust&nbsp;
her this time. After a lot of convincing,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:56.480 --> 00:10:02.400
Katie gives him the permission to film Ricky.
The next day, on Paco’s request Dr.Bernard calls&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:02.400 --> 00:10:08.480
the press in front of Katie’s apartment complex&nbsp;
for Ricky’s media debut. Katie and Paco present&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:08.480 --> 00:10:13.600
themselves as a happy married family even though&nbsp;
they aren’t married. They also put a rope on&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:13.600 --> 00:10:19.120
Ricky to keep him from flying away. To demonstrate&nbsp;
Ricky’s ability, they let go of him as Katie holds&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:19.120 --> 00:10:25.520
the rope. The baby begins to fly like a bird much&nbsp;
to everyone’s astonishment. Katie is also excited&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:25.520 --> 00:10:32.000
to see her baby fly so high for the first time&nbsp;
and as a result, she gets lost in the moment and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:32.000 --> 00:10:37.680
accidentally lets go of the rope. Ricky flies&nbsp;
away, prompting Katie and others to chase&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:37.680 --> 00:10:43.280
after the baby. Passing through the lake, Ricky&nbsp;
flies into the woods. After waiting for a while,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:43.280 --> 00:10:48.960
the media loses interest in Ricky and leaves&nbsp;
but Katie refuses to move from her spot. 
&nbsp;

00:10:48.960 --> 00:10:53.920
Dr. Bernad later joins Paco by the lake and&nbsp;
suggests that Ricky must have been shot by&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:53.920 --> 00:10:59.840
a hunter or is starving to death somewhere.&nbsp;
Upset, Paco blames himself and laments that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:59.840 --> 00:11:04.240
Katie will never forgive him for this.  
For the next few days, Katie and others&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:04.240 --> 00:11:09.520
spend their time distributing missing posters&nbsp;
for Ricky around the market but in vain. 
&nbsp;

00:11:10.160 --> 00:11:16.000
Several weeks pass by and others move on with&nbsp;
their life but Katie still longs for her son.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:16.000 --> 00:11:20.960
One day, she leaves her home for yet another&nbsp;
“walk” by the lake. It turns out the despondent&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:20.960 --> 00:11:27.520
Katie has decided to end her life. However, as she&nbsp;
proceeds to drown herself, she hears Ricky's voice&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:27.520 --> 00:11:32.880
and his flapping wings, as he returns.&nbsp;
Overjoyed, Katie runs towards her baby,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:32.880 --> 00:11:38.000
who has considerably grown up. The baby&nbsp;
looks happy and Katie apologizes to him,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:38.000 --> 00:11:43.040
saying that she let go of him because he looked&nbsp;
so happy in the air. The baby then flies away&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:43.040 --> 00:11:49.520
and Katie realizes that Ricky’s happiness is in&nbsp;
the air. She returns home and lovingly embraces&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:49.520 --> 00:11:53.760
her family after a long while.
